error[TDS0216]: can't loop over a value of type `Int`
  ┌─ TDS0216-not-iterable.tds:2:14
  │
2 │     for i in 10:
  │              ^^ this has type `Int`
  │
  = note: `for` works on lists, ranges and strings
  = help: to count, use a range: `for i in 0..<n:`
